msgid ""
"Fport should be connected to TX2 via a bi-directional inverter and "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"Fport 应通过双向反相器连接到 TX2，并将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405-mini.rst:119
